    "chunk_text": "; Gelice se \u00feridda. & ealle seofon hi h\u00e6fdon & s\u00e6d ne l\u00e6fdon; Ealra \u00e6ftemest \u00fea for\u00f0ferde \u00fe\u00e6t wif. On \u00feam \u00e6riste, hwylces \u00feara seofona bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t wif; Hi ealle hi h\u00e6fdon. \u00dea andswarode him se H\u00e6lend, hu ne dweliga\u00f0 ge for\u00feam \u00fee ge nyton \u00fea halgan gewritu ne Godes So\u00f0lice \u00feonne hi of dea\u00f0e arisa\u00fe ne wifia\u00fe hi ne ne gyftigea\u00f0, ac hi synt swylce godes englas on Be \u00feam deadum \u00fe\u00e6t hi arison, ne r\u00e6dde ge on Moyses bec hu God to him cw\u00e6\u00fe ofer \u00feone Nis God deadra ac he hys lybbendra; So\u00f0lice swy\u00fee ge dweligea\u00f0. \u00d0a geneal\u00e6hte him an of \u00feam bocerum \u00fee he gehyrde hi smeagende & geseah \u00fe\u00e6t he him wel \u00dea andswarode & him, \u00fe\u00e6t is \u00fe\u00e6t m\u00e6ste bebod ealra, Israhel, gehyr, urne Drihten god he is. And lufa \u00feinne Drihten God of ealre \u00feinre heortan & of ealre \u00feinre sawle eallum \u00feinum mode & of So\u00f0lice is o\u00f0er \u00feissum gelic, lufa \u00feinne nehstan swa \u00fee sylfne; Nys o\u00f0er mare bebod. \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00fe se bocere, Lareow, well \u00feu on so\u00fee cw\u00e6de \u00fe\u00e6t an God is & nis o\u00f0er butan him. & \u00f0\u00e6t he si gelufod of ealre heortan & of eallum andgyte & of ealre sawle & of ealre streng\u00f0e, & \u00d0a se H\u00e6lend geseah \u00fe\u00e6t he him wislice andwyrde he s\u00e6",
